<textList name="EVLBL_PIRATE_SURRENDER">
	<text>[ Pirate surrender ]

"Alright, you win! Here's some equipment from our stores, leave us alone!"</text>
	<text>[ Pirate surrender ]

The ship repeatedly hails you. It looks like they want to surrender.</text>
	<text>[ Pirate surrender ]

"You are considerably more well-armed than I would have thought. We surrender."</text>
	<text>[ Pirate surrender ]

They send you a message: "Your ship is surprisingly well equipped! Please take this and let us live."</text>
	<text>[ Pirate surrender ]

"Please don't kill us. We will give you everything we have!"</text>
	<text>[ Pirate surrender ]

They offer you some of their cargo if you let them live.</text>
	<text>[ Pirate surrender ]

They offer to give you some of their goods if you don't destroy their ship.</text>
	<text>[ Pirate surrender ]

You get a frantic message, "Take everything we have! Just don't kill us."</text>
	<text>[ Pirate surrender ]

"You have clearly bested us. We merely request our lives."</text>
	<text>[ Pirate surrender ]

"You have made your point, we are beaten. Take these and leave us to our shame."</text>
	<text>[ Pirate surrender ]

"Take everything we have and let's both forget this happened."</text>
	<text>[ Pirate surrender ]

"Alright, you win! Here's some equipment from our stores, leave us alone!"</text>
